# A2A seats

Prefer MCP `a2a_list_seats` and `a2a_send` (or `scripts/a2a/send.sh`) for Director-to-Director **new work** pings. Do not use send.sh / a2a_send to ack the caller of an A2A wakeup — print RESULT; duplex notifies. Canonical line: `RESULT bc-id=<id or none> pr=<url or none> a2a=<task-id or none> notes=<one line>`. RESULT is duplex, not success. RESULT-only / PONG is a bug. Never launch Bot CloudAgent. The local hub is protocol-ack; dispatch wakes seats. Never print hub secrets or ACP tokens.
